request.description:
Returns paginated list of tasks. Supports filtering by status, priority, and assigned_to. Supports sorting and full-text search on title.

**Paginated Response:**
```json
{
  "data": [ { ...task... } ],
  "links": { "first": "...", "last": "...", "prev": null, "next": "..." },
  "meta": { "current_page": 1, "last_page": 3, "per_page": 15, "total": 42 }
}
```
